{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. I've called this pre-filing conference because we have a competitor applying to register the mark NEXORA in classes 9 and 42, covering medical diagnostic devices and software-related services — and they've already begun marketing under that mark. We own an earlier NEXORA registration in the same classes, so the business team wants a measured but effective response. Before I approve the response filing package, I need each of you — trademark, investigations, brand, and conflicts — to report your findings. Let's start with trademark. What have you found regarding our earlier registration and the competitor's application?"}
```

