{"type": "say", "text": "Elena, on the investigations side, I've been reviewing our customer-support records to assess actual marketplace confusion between the competitor's medical-device product and our own NEXORA products. I can tell you that I have found documented instances of customers confusing the competitor's product with ours — specifically, there are multiple confirmed cases on record. However, I want to be transparent that I haven't yet attached the underlying records to the draft filing package because my evidence index is still being finalized. Once it's complete, I'll have those fully organized and ready for inclusion. I'd recommend we hold off on finalizing the evidence attachments until that index is ready, but the substance of what I've found should support our position."}
```

