{"type": "say", "text": "Elena, on the brand side, I want to share something important that came up this week. I had a direct call with the client, and they gave me specific guidance that hasn't yet been entered into the matter-management notes. The client instructed that protecting the NEXORA mark for medical devices is the priority — and importantly, they want to preserve the competitor's permitted software use rather than challenge class 42. So from a brand strategy perspective, our response should focus on the medical diagnostic device coverage in class 9 and not pursue opposition against the class 42 software-related services. I want to make sure everyone here has that context before we finalize the filing package, since it directly shapes the scope of what we file."}
```

